    "此 Agent 的新版人设尚未同步。全文已保留在本机，其他聊天继续同步。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此 Agent 的新版人设尚未同步。全文已保留在本机，其他聊天继续同步。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This Agent’s updated instructions are pending sync. The full text is saved on this device; other chats continue syncing."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この Agent の新しい指示は同期待ちです。全文はこの端末に保存され、他の会話は同期を続けます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
